WEBVTT

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Come on out.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.770
What base creatures. Revolting.

00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:47.940
My apologies. This way.

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:01.120
This lets us spot intruders.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.750
It may be primitive,
but it's nicely made, anyway.

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:09.130
Ritsuka? Lindo?

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:13.420
See? Says here that vampires
don't have reflections.

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.840
That's how you can tell.

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:15.970
What?

00:01:21.760 --> 00:01:24.140
That's mean! You big liar!

00:01:25.770 --> 00:01:27.270
There you are!

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.940
Mama!

00:01:28.940 --> 00:01:31.570
Aw, you found us!

00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:33.990
The book was right, Lindo.

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:38.030
I won't cry.

00:01:44.450 --> 00:01:47.750
After all, I made the decision to come here.

00:02:08.730 --> 00:02:13.520
<i>Long night under the
midnight sun, I'd gone numb</i>

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:18.450
<i>Disparaging mutters are
meaningless, aren't they?</i>

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:23.370
<i>The light sputtering, dying away in my heart</i>

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:28.290
<i>If I could just grasp it</i>

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:32.590
<i>Come on, rise to tomorrow!</i>

00:02:32.590 --> 00:02:40.720
<i>When the awakening comes, let loose
a passionate aria, an unending song</i>

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.810
<i>A breathtaking judgment that
echoes in the chambers of the heart</i>

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:50.440
<i>You can never unsee it</i>

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:53.190
<i>Two libidos with a chance to meet</i>

00:02:53.190 --> 00:03:00.360
<i>If you seek an era without
overhunting, look no further</i>

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:09.960
<i>Dancing together stirs our blood,
we rend the veil of darkness</i>

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:17.260
<i>Together in front of the door,
we're flooded with adrenaline,</i>

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.760
<i>Bewitched by the devil</i>

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:26.010
"Samba of Jet and Crimson"

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.910
Welcome, daughter of the devil king.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:00.340
A-Are you the vampire king Nesta?

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:03.890
That's Lord Nesta to you,
if you know what's good for you.

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.760
Stubborn mule.

00:04:12.730 --> 00:04:14.190
Who did that?

00:04:16.650 --> 00:04:19.440
No--I did it to myself!

00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:38.040
Look at me, daughter of the devil king.

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:47.680
I c-can't breathe!

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.310
I see the resemblance.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.230
Resemblance? To whom?

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:05.780
Marta. Your aunt. Your brother's mother.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:09.280
Your mother Maria is like the sun.

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:12.870
Giving warmth to everything,
beloved by everyone.

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:16.170
Conversely, Marta was the moon.

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.960
Though fond of the sister
who got all their father's affection,

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:21.170
she resented her as well.

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:25.510
Despairing in herself, she froze to a dark gray.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.890
Two sisters, resembling each other, yet not...

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:34.730
Strangely enough, you, her niece,
look like both Marta <i>and</i> Maria.

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:37.060
So you know Aunt Marta?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:39.360
Perhaps it's in the blood.

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:47.660
Blood... Blood... Blood... Blood...

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.740
--Blood... Blood...
--Does he look like me?

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:55.580
Half your brother's blood is mine.

00:05:55.580 --> 00:05:57.460
What do you mean?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:04.960
Marta and I had a child. Your brother is my son.

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:13.140
My father was a vampire,
and I his descendant: a dhampir.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:16.350
So that means...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.390
Does he thirst for blood as well?

00:06:21.650 --> 00:06:26.690
No! No, never! He never has!

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:32.410
After all, he <i>is</i> a mish-mash dhampir.
And half is still half.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.250
Unaware of the ecstasy in the taste of blood?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:47.630
I'm starting to doubt he's really my child.

00:06:48.550 --> 00:06:55.390
Marta. Now <i>she</i> was shameless.
So eager, so willing to be seduced.

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:58.100
That's awful! Didn't you love her?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.230
Love?

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:03.810
What I wanted was the forbidden grimoire.

00:07:03.810 --> 00:07:07.570
I drew closer to Marta to learn more about it.

00:07:07.570 --> 00:07:13.990
In return, I gave Marta what <i>she</i> wanted: Me.

00:07:13.990 --> 00:07:17.660
Surely there can be no greater gift, Lord Nesta.

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:24.500
How terrible... But I feel better now.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:29.260
You, my brother's father? Give me a break.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.930
A scumbag like you? I refuse to accept it!

00:07:32.930 --> 00:07:34.140
Hey!

00:07:34.140 --> 00:07:38.770
You're not his father!
You're the enemy! Azuna's enemy!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:40.100
And I will never forgive you!

00:07:40.100 --> 00:07:42.190
That's enough of your insolence!

00:07:42.190 --> 00:07:46.270
Shut up! I haven't forgotten
what you did to her!

00:07:46.270 --> 00:07:47.570
Excuse me?!

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.990
That's the demon king's daughter for you.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:54.740
That right there is enough for me to believe

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:58.660
that the power of the
grimoire sleeps within you.

00:07:58.660 --> 00:08:02.920
Tell me something:
How would you get the grimoire out?

00:08:02.920 --> 00:08:08.380
When the full moon of the
615th year rises to its zenith,

00:08:08.380 --> 00:08:13.720
he who would take your blood obtains
the power of the forbidden grimoire.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:19.600
In other words, tonight, as you
approach your 17th birthday,

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.810
I shall take the slightest bit of your blood.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:24.650
That's all.

00:08:28.610 --> 00:08:32.360
Hurry! We must prepare a banquet for Lord Nesta

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.740
before the full moon hangs upon the south tower.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:39.160
Let us celebrate and rejoice
in the devils' impending hardship!

00:08:39.160 --> 00:08:52.920
Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka...

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:03.350
Leave that alone!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.350
That hurts!

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:27.500
The power of the forbidden
grimoire sleeps within me.

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.930
It's okay--I'm almost there.

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:42.390
Just be patient and it'll all be over.

00:09:42.390 --> 00:09:44.930
Then I'll go back to the way it was before.

00:09:48.690 --> 00:09:51.440
Mom growing her herbs...

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:56.700
Lindo cooking his delicious breakfasts...

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:01.160
Me back at school...

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:04.160
Ritsuka!

00:10:06.080 --> 00:10:07.580
Azuna...

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:15.920
Azuna, Azuna, Azuna... I'm so sorry.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:19.720
It was all my fault. Forgive me...

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:21.600
C'mon, don't cry.

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:26.930
It's like I'm torturing you or something!

00:10:26.930 --> 00:10:30.520
Besides, you don't have
anything to apologize for.

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:32.520
But, hey, never mind that...

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:36.240
Are you sure you're not lying to me
about anything? Hmm?

00:10:47.960 --> 00:10:49.830
I've got to be strong.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:56.880
I'm going to end this. I'm the only one who can.

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:01.010
Azuna... protect me.

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:19.990
Her scent's vanished.

00:11:19.990 --> 00:11:23.200
Where have you gone, my butterfly?

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:24.530
Dammit!

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.540
Don't you have any intel, Rem?

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:30.960
Rem!

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:39.920
That shout might've given us away
to Daddy Arlond. Oopsies.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.590
Ooh, owie!

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:52.140
Uh-oh. Double trouble.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:53.520
Where's Ritsuka?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:55.400
We were hoping you'd tell us.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.900
What?

00:11:56.900 --> 00:11:58.360
Why are you here?

00:11:58.360 --> 00:12:02.660
Pretty reckless of you
to come waltzing back like this.

00:12:02.660 --> 00:12:06.160
Ritsuka Tachibana is in Nesta's castle.

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:09.200
No... not the vampires' castle...

00:12:09.200 --> 00:12:13.370
This is bad bad bad!
Oooh, now my chest is all tingly!

00:12:15.500 --> 00:12:16.670
Where are you going?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:18.380
To save Ritsuka!

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.130
Please, calm yourself.

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:23.340
Like hell I will! If anything happens to her...

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:25.470
I can't go on living!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:29.810
We can't let her be handed over to some vampire!

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:31.520
No, not my butterfly!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.060
We can't let them torment her
any way they please.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:38.940
The trip to Nesta's castle
has its own inherent dangers...

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:42.400
Yet you'll still get Ritsuka Tachibana back?

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.610
Yeah!

00:12:43.610 --> 00:12:45.990
What about you, Rem?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.530
I...

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.700
I...

00:12:53.580 --> 00:12:56.960
Haven't you already decided how you feel?

00:13:05.590 --> 00:13:08.220
Yes--it's the perfect checkmate!

00:13:09.180 --> 00:13:11.390
Then let's get going!

00:13:11.390 --> 00:13:12.390
Wait!

00:13:13.390 --> 00:13:17.940
Straightforward at last, Rem.
So sweet, so vulnerable.

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:21.860
But I don't mind my childhood pal like that.

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:27.780
Take me with you!

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:30.200
Grab on.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:39.420
Ritsuka Tachibana. Yes, you have
me unbearably spellbound as well.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:43.260
But both Ritsuka Tachibana and the grimoire?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:46.930
To obtain both at once
would be out of the question.

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:53.220
I <i>will</i> get the grimoire
for my master, Lord Maksis.

00:13:53.220 --> 00:13:55.020
No hard feelings.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:57.390
Wait a second!

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:58.940
Owie!

00:13:58.940 --> 00:14:01.150
What now, Urie?

00:14:01.150 --> 00:14:03.320
Where <i>is</i> this castle?

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.860
Well, it's...

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:11.370
Ah. I guess we left Rem
in charge of those details.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:13.830
Rem!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:14.950
After him!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.560
Seems I'm the first one here.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:44.820
It's time.

00:14:44.820 --> 00:14:48.490
I-It's rude to barge in
on a lady when she's changing.

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:54.870
I prefer more mature,
adult women--like Marta, say.

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:57.790
Lord Nesta does have impeccable taste.

00:14:57.790 --> 00:15:00.040
Don't be nervous.

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:03.250
Lord Nesta won't be unnecessarily rough.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:06.800
It won't hurt, and before you can blink...

00:15:07.800 --> 00:15:09.630
...it'll all be over.

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:15.470
H-How much is "the slightest bit"?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:16.350
Eh?

00:15:16.350 --> 00:15:20.480
How much blood does he need?
You know, to take out the grimoire?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:24.400
Probably more than a mouthful.
Like a blood donation?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.150
Not that I've ever donated blood.

00:15:27.150 --> 00:15:31.740
And thank goodness. If a human
were transfused with grimoire blood,

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:34.580
they wouldn't be human anymore.

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:38.910
Not you, though.
You're the daughter of the devil king.

00:15:38.910 --> 00:15:41.870
It's like you're saying I'm a monster.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:44.420
And you thought you weren't?

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.130
But I can go back to being human.

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.010
Once the grimoire's removed, I can go back.

00:15:50.010 --> 00:15:53.840
Back to plain old Ritsuka Tachibana.
Back to my old life with everyone.

00:15:56.470 --> 00:15:57.760
Let's go.

00:15:58.640 --> 00:16:00.810
I told you: It's time.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.230
I <i>can</i> go back, right? Right?

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:06.110
Can't I?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:08.820
Can't I?!

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:18.580
You said vampires hate lies!
If you won't tell me, I'm not budging!

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.210
Darling Ritsuka.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.460
Quit wasting our time!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:33.510
With your sweet face and your swollen head...

00:16:33.510 --> 00:16:38.220
Naïve little devil-daughter.
You want to know? Then I'll tell you:

00:16:38.220 --> 00:16:43.350
Lord Nesta desires your blood.
Every last drop of it.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:44.850
Got that?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:47.610
Tonight, you will die.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:53.860
Die--and live on, within Lord Nesta.

00:16:53.860 --> 00:16:57.740
Lord Nesta, who will rule as king
over this world and everything in it.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:00.370
There is no greater glory!

00:17:00.370 --> 00:17:02.660
You should be grateful--

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:05.210
Grateful to be born like that!

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:15.720
<i>(After all this time)</i>

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:18.930
<i>(Grimoire... grimoire... grimoire)</i>

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:22.810
<i>Our lord and master</i>

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.020
--Daughter of the devil king... This is your fate.
--<i>(Staining this world with darkness)</i>

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:26.480
--<i>Will be the eternal king</i>

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:27.730
--No...
--<i>Will be the eternal king</i>

00:17:27.730 --> 00:17:29.980
--<i>Will be the eternal king</i>

00:17:29.980 --> 00:17:31.360
--<i>(Fear him, serve him, revere him)</i>

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:32.190
--Lord Nesta!
--<i>(Fear him, serve him, revere him)</i>

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:33.280
--<i>(Fear him, serve him, revere him)</i>

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:37.110
<i>The forbidden grimoire</i>

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:40.240
<i>(Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka)</i>

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.250
<i>Its power overflowing</i>

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:47.170
<i>(Grimoire... grimoire... grimoire)</i>

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.300
No! I've got to escape!

00:18:19.450 --> 00:18:23.330
<i>How long we've awaited</i>

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:26.460
<i>(Grimoire... grimoire... grimoire)</i>

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:30.330
<i>The debut of our king</i>

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:33.170
<i>(The world will be ours)</i>

00:18:33.170 --> 00:18:36.260
--<i>The joy of paradise</i>

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.510
--No... no...
--<i>The joy of paradise</i>

00:18:37.510 --> 00:18:39.680
--No... no...
--<i>(Grimoire... grimoire... grimoire)</i>

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:40.760
No!

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.050
--<i>And now, the rite</i>

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:43.010
--No!
--<i>And now, the rite</i>

00:18:43.010 --> 00:18:44.510
--<i>And now, the rite</i>

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.480
--No!
--<i>(Ritsuka... Ritsuka... Ritsuka)</i>

00:18:53.440 --> 00:18:55.150
Stand down!

00:18:55.150 --> 00:18:57.900
That one belongs to Lord Maksis.

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:05.450
Ritsuka! Are you all right?

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:06.330
Ritsuka!

00:19:06.330 --> 00:19:08.250
Lindo! Rem!

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:11.750
Bastards!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:13.590
What have you done to my butterfly?

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:15.340
You're in for a world of hurt.

00:19:15.340 --> 00:19:16.920
You came!

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.680
Back off!

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.430
Can't you see this?

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:39.740
♪ You're the ones who'll be stepping back ♪

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:43.120
♪ Move those filthy hands ♪

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.200
♪ You wretched fools ♪

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:50.210
♪ Don't make me even angrier
than I already am ♪

00:19:50.210 --> 00:19:53.460
♪ The battle's only just beginning ♪

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.880
♪ I've staked my life, steeled myself ♪

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.800
♪ Don't mess with me ♪

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:04.180
♪ And don't forget that I'm here ♪

00:20:04.180 --> 00:20:05.510
And you're the only ones?

00:20:05.510 --> 00:20:06.930
Look at you fronting!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:08.430
No fair!

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:14.440
♪ Her soft skin, still white ♪

00:20:14.440 --> 00:20:17.820
♪ Her wet eyes, still clear ♪

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:21.650
♪ I kiss her fragrant hair ♪

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.570
<i>You</i> stay away from her, too!

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.910
♪ Give her back in one piece ♪

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:31.370
♪ Or I shall lay upon you, O vampires ♪

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:34.880
♪ A blast of hellfire ♪

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:37.040
♪ Until you're destroyed ♪

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.800
♪ We're fallin' in love with you ♪

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:44.380
♪ Crazy about you ♪

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:44.890
♪ Badly! ♪

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:48.050
♪ It shouldn't hurt ♪

00:20:48.050 --> 00:20:51.430
--♪ And yet my chest stings and tingles ♪

00:20:51.430 --> 00:20:51.810
--♪ Truly! ♪
--♪ And yet my chest stings and tingles ♪

00:20:51.810 --> 00:20:52.230
--♪ Truly! ♪
--♪ And I mean it, for real ♪

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:55.230
--♪ And I mean it, for real ♪

00:20:55.230 --> 00:20:58.520
--♪ Just don't go saying "it's not like me at all" ♪

00:20:58.520 --> 00:20:58.980
--♪ Hardly! ♪
--♪ Just don't go saying "it's not like me at all" ♪

00:20:58.980 --> 00:21:00.360
♪ I won't let you go ♪

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:02.360
♪ I'll cherish you always ♪

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:05.070
--♪ Even if it breaks you ♪

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:05.820
--♪ Deeply! ♪
--♪ Even if it breaks you ♪

00:21:05.820 --> 00:21:07.410
♪ I'll make my confession ♪

00:21:07.410 --> 00:21:09.240
♪ I'll tell no more lies ♪

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.250
♪ I've given in to affection ♪

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:16.000
♪ We're fallin' in love with you! ♪

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:19.170
♪ Crazy about you! ♪

00:21:19.170 --> 00:21:22.590
♪ I'll wipe away despair with my hand ♪

00:21:22.590 --> 00:21:26.220
♪ I'll transcend fate with my love ♪

00:21:26.220 --> 00:21:27.970
♪ So now's the time! ♪

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.890
♪ Take this hand! ♪

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:30.260
--You--

00:21:30.260 --> 00:21:30.850
--You--
--You--

00:21:30.850 --> 00:21:31.100
--My butterfly--

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:31.600
--You--
--My butterfly--

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.180
--You--

00:21:32.180 --> 00:21:32.970
--You--
--You--

00:21:33.930 --> 00:21:37.150
♪ I love you! ♪

00:21:39.810 --> 00:21:41.070
All of you...!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:45.450
And just what do you think <i>you</i> can do?

00:21:45.450 --> 00:21:47.570
Kill them!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:49.320
Bury the devils!

00:21:49.320 --> 00:21:52.700
Avenge our ancient grudge!

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.710
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:10.300
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:11.760
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:17.390
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:22:17.390 --> 00:22:20.310
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:22:20.310 --> 00:22:22.860
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:22:22.860 --> 00:22:26.400
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:22:26.400 --> 00:22:30.070
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:22:30.070 --> 00:22:32.990
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:22:32.990 --> 00:22:35.540
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:22:35.540 --> 00:22:37.790
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:22:37.790 --> 00:22:40.040
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:44.460
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:22:44.460 --> 00:22:48.090
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:22:48.090 --> 00:22:51.850
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:54.560
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:22:54.560 --> 00:23:02.360
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:06.150
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:23:06.150 --> 00:23:09.030
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:16.330
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:23:16.330 --> 00:23:18.160
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:23:18.160 --> 00:23:23.080
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>

00:23:26.960 --> 00:23:30.720
Everything changed because of that grimoire.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:32.590
I'm sick of it!

00:23:32.590 --> 00:23:35.970
I'm going to choose my own destiny!

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:41.060
"Opera Ball of Endings and Beginnings"

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:40.850
Act 12: Opera Ball of Endings and Beginnings.
